closed_at: "2026-07-28T05:05:29.269Z"
author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: A failing regression test proves absent tags no longer throw; canonical normalization emits an empty sorted tag array; search/read integration remains green; full coverage and release reliability gates pass; Sentry is resolved only after exact fix evidence.
parent: pm-rnpb
severity: high
environment: production
resolution: "Runtime normalization safely defaults absent/non-array tags and filters non-string entries, while history replay explicitly preserves legacy structural hash semantics for non-empty states without tag arrays and canonical empty-document hashes."
expected_result: Search and all SDK read paths normalize absent tags safely without emitting a raw TypeError.
actual_result: "The Sentry reproduction is fixed, pm-lty and all 2,154 history streams retain their recorded hashes, and focused/full/static/type gates pass."
affected_version: 2026.7.28
fixed_version: unreleased
component: core/item-format
regression: true
