  "2026-07-28T04:38:33.732Z","harness:codex","TDD evidence: the new direct-normalization regression test failed at src/core/item/item-format.ts tags.map with the same TypeError as Sentry PM-CLI-2N. After guarding the runtime collection and filtering non-string legacy entries, the focused 9-test suite passes and canonical output supplies [] or normalized string tags."
  "2026-07-28T04:50:04.195Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence: both linked suites passed through isolated PM contexts; the full 381-file suite passed 6,447 tests with literal 100% statements (44,751/44,751), branches (31,849/31,849), functions (9,160/9,160), and lines (43,468/43,468). ESLint, zero-clone jscpd, 100% docstring/static quality, package boundary, SDK parity, token budgets, SDK surface/import costs, CLI transport floor, and all TypeScript project checks passed."
  "2026-07-28T04:51:19.158Z","harness:codex","Delivery PR: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/788 at implementation head 70762416c. The PR body links this canonical item and its regenerated changelog entry; the final review pass will run after the PM evidence commit."
  "2026-07-28T04:56:20.846Z","harness:codex","CI discovery: final-head static validation found pm-lty chain drift because the missing-tags runtime fix made a pre-create replay state canonicalizable and changed its historical after_hash. The fix must retain structural fallback hashing for replay metadata without an array-valued tags field while keeping SDK normalization safe."
  "2026-07-28T05:05:22.580Z","harness:codex","Final compatibility evidence: replayHash now retains canonical hashing for the truly empty document, preserves structural fallback hashing for non-empty legacy states without an array-valued tags field, and retains catch fallback for other malformed values. The exact CI validate command passed after a fresh derived-cache scan with 2,154 histories, zero chain/hash drift, and clean storage; pm-lty verifies. Full coverage passed 44,752/44,752 statements, 31,853/31,853 branches, 9,160/9,160 functions, and 43,469/43,469 lines; lint/static/type gates passed."
